40
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:23.441
Sokha and Dara go to a café. They look at the menu. Sokha would like an iced coffee. Dara would like a bubble tea, but they haven't got any, so she orders a milk tea. They also order food: two sandwiches and a mango smoothie. Sokha asks for a takeaway cake for his mum. They leave a small tip.

